        "original_id": "0a9e7069-6466-5d81-8d8c-a4a8b40da785",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Reg Presley, Mike Newell, Charlotte Coleman\n- Works: Love Is All Around, Four Weddings and a Funeral, Love Actually, Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit, Worzel Gummidge, Marmalade Atkins\n- Roles: Scarlett, Jess, Sue\n\nFacts:\n- Four Weddings and a Funeral is a 1994 British romantic comedy film directed by Mike Newell.\n- Reg Presley wrote the song Love Is All Around.\n- Reg Presley's song Love Is All Around was featured in the films Four Weddings and a Funeral and Love Actually.\n- Charlotte Ninon Coleman was an English actress who lived from 3 April 1968 to 14 November 2001.\n- Charlotte Coleman was best known for playing Scarlett in the film Four Weddings and a Funeral.\n- Charlotte Coleman was also known for playing Jess in the television drama Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit.\n- Charlotte Coleman played Sue in Worzel Gummidge and the character Marmalade Atkins in childhood roles.",
